<title>USA: Maine official statement has typo error - Goldman.</title>
<headline>Maine official statement has typo error - Goldman.</headline>
<text>
<p>MAINE STATE HOUSING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $14,999,693.30</p>
<p>HOUSING FINANCE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996 SERIES I (AMT)</p>
<p>THE INSIDE COVER OF THE FINAL OFFICIAL STATEMENT CONTAINS</p>
<p>A TYPOGRAPHICAL ERROR.  THE INTEREST RATE FOR THE 2000</p>
<p>MATURITY IS SHOWN AS 4%. THE CORRECT RATE IS 4.75%.</p>
<p>CORRECTED COPIES OF THE INSIDE COVER WILL BE DISTRIBUTED</p>
<p>TO ANYONE WHO WAS ORIGINALLY SENT COPIES OF THE FINAL OFFICIAL</p>
<p>STATEMENT FROM THE PRINTER.</p>
<p>YOU MUST ALSO SEND A CORRECTED INSIDE COVER SHEET TO ANY</p>
<p>ONE TO WHOM YOU DISTRIBUTED A COPY OF THE FINAL OFFICIAL</p>
<p>STATEMENT.</p>
<p>ADDITIONAL COPIES OF THE CORRECTED INSIDE COVER SHEET AND</p>
<p>THE ACCOMPANYING TRANSMITTAL LETTER CAN BE OBTAINED FROM:</p>
<p>			 NETWORK PRINTERS (ATTN. KEN MYERS)</p>
<p>			 12 WEST 37TH STREET, 8TH FLOOR</p>
<p>			 NEW YORK, NY 10018</p>
<p>			 1-212-868-1607</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>Fleet Securities</p>
<p>Key Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
